    State: N/A

    Evaluation: Pedagogical.


3 - Intuition
    ---------

    The package starts from ordinary Rocq terms:

      ingredient ─▶ recipe ─▶ cooked ingredient

    It then reads lambda-calculus ideas through typed examples:

      syntax          variable, application, abstraction
      computation     beta and eta by definitional equality
      names           alpha-conversion and free-variable intuition
      substitution    everyday replacement scenes
      metatheory      small typed analogues of confluence and normalization


4 - Tree
    ----

    Stdlib
     ▼
    S001_00_Premises
     ▼
    S001_01__Lambda_Calculus


5 - Files
    -----

    S001_00_Premises.v

      First tutorial layer. Introduces terms, basic types, functions, a small
      weekday datatype, computation, proof terms, and implication as function
      construction.

    S001_01__Lambda_Calculus.v

      Lambda-calculus tutorial layer. Presents the standard laws in
      `unicodemath` comments and illustrates them through typed everyday
      examples.


